<h1>Your account email was changed</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>On <strong>{{when}}</strong>, the email of your <strong>{{appName}}</strong> account was changed to <strong>{{newEmail}}</strong>. This address will no longer receive account messages.</p>
<p>If it was you, no action is needed.</p>
<p><strong>Don't recognize this change?</strong> Contact <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a> right away.</p>
